AI does not need any introduction but an understanding of the nature of AI and whether in its. Current state it can meet the needs of Dwight Global community will help in providing responses to the below survey. \
\
The AI tools in the market (ChatGPt, Gemini, Claude, \'85) are termed as Generative AI, which is generate new content and also can analyze the data that you provide. \
\
This only solves a portion of Dwight community\'92s needs and we cannot fully rely on these tools for the following reason. They are not trained with Dwight Online user data. And trying to train our core needs will inadvertently lead to release of sensitive information..\
\
Use cases for students\
\
My final exams are in a week. Tell me how best to allocate my time. \
\
ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini will provide you some response but it is generic and not tailored to your specific needs. \
\
\'97\
However, an AI that is aware of Dwight Community\'92s needs will approach it by tailoring its repose to the specific individual. It will look at your calendar in Canvas LMS, it is aware that you are enrolled in 5 subjects. It then looks at your performance in the past 3 terms and see how you did in assignments, how well you did in specific topics in each subject. It can then generate a response that is highly customized to the user to maximize their study time. \
\
Currently, Calendly had capability, but it does not have the context of a Dwight Online student, nor does it have access to student\'92s information (past Grades, Assignments, Available free time slots).\
\
